WEBVTT

00:04:28.792 --> 00:04:31.934
I hear folks saying,
I had one activist say to me

00:04:31.958 --> 00:04:34.226
that the pain that he was feeling

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.809
was too large to fit into his body.

00:04:37.833 --> 00:04:40.143
And without thinking about it,
I said right back,

00:04:40.167 --> 00:04:43.684
"That's because it's too large
to fit into a lifetime."

00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:49.226
What we're seeing isn't just
the response to one gruesome,

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.833
cruel, public execution.

00:04:53.667 --> 00:04:54.917
A lynching.

00:04:55.792 --> 00:04:59.184
It's not just the reaction
to three of them:

00:04:59.208 --> 00:05:02.476
Ahmaud Arbery, Breonna Taylor